@startuml 在线支付顺序图
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 80
skinparam participantBackgroundColor white
skinparam actorBackgroundColor white
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor white
skinparam defaultWidth 400
skinparam sequenceArrowColor Black
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam ParticipantPadding 40


actor "买家" as Buyer
participant "OrderDetail.vue" as Frontend
participant "PaymentController" as Controller
participant "数据库" as Database

Buyer -> Frontend++: 点击"立即支付",选择支付方式
Frontend -> Controller++: POST /mobile/payments/simulate
Controller -> Database++: 查询订单信息(校验状态和归属)
Database --> Controller--: 返回订单实体
Controller -> Controller: 验证支付金额
Controller -> Database++: 查询支付记录
Database --> Controller--: 返回支付记录
Controller -> Controller: 支付(生成交易流水号)
Controller -> Database++: INSERT INTO payments
Database --> Controller--: 返回paymentId
Controller -> Database++: 更新订单状态为已支付
Database --> Controller--: 返回更新结果
Controller -> Database++: INSERT INTO transaction_records
Database --> Controller--: 返回插入结果
Controller --> Frontend--: 返回支付成功
Frontend --> Buyer--: 显示"支付成功"提示

@enduml
